  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Xi appears as the silhouette of a concave land, a secluded domain of heaven and earth.",
      "chapters": [
        1999
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "When used in battle it is again a concave secluded-domain silhouette that absorbs what enters it.",
      "chapters": [
        2003
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "At the eye of the storm, a qi harvest fruit absorbs surrounding qi currents. After it detonates, a silhouette appears above the baby’s head, carrying a rank nine aura more complete than the incomplete Human Sea. The baby shouts Xi in a long tone. Surrounding qi currents rush into that silhouette until none remain around Wu Shuai and Wu Yong. The whole of Qi Jue grotto-heaven turns into qi currents and is absorbed.",
      "chapters": [
        1999
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_human_sea",
        "char_wu_shuai",
        "char_wu_yong",
        "loc_qi_jue_grotto_heaven"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Inside Demon Judgment Board, Zhou Xiong Xin notes two domains with little description: one Hu, the other Xi.",
      "chapters": [
        1999
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_demon_judgment_board",
        "char_zhou_xiong_xin"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In immemorial white heaven, Demon Immortal Qi Jue shouts Xi again and a secluded domain silhouette draws in a stretch of heavenly wind qi wall, then enters his nose. He changes course southwest, arrives at turbulent flow sea area, and concludes that this sea area must hold a fragment of Xi, which is why it can create such currents. He plunges in to retrieve and absorb that fragment before seeking Qi Sea Ancestor.",
      "chapters": [
        2002
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fragment-of-xi",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_demon_immortal_qi_jue",
        "char_qi_sea_ancestor"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Against Qi Sea Ancestor, Demon Immortal Qi Jue shouts Xi and a secluded domain absorbs a pair of black and white hands. The secluded domain of heaven and earth is named Xi, then Xi Land. Fang Yuan’s qi path killer moves are absorbed. Demon Immortal Qi Jue says he has dismantled turbulent flow sea area and completely fixed Xi Land, and that with this he can counter all qi path methods in the world. All qi path killer moves are absorbed unless they surpass Xi Land’s limits, and the fully repaired domain is a qualitative change in his battle strength.",
      "chapters": [
        2003
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "qi-path-absorption",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    }
  ],
